 space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1999,"final_formatted":"$19.99 USD","initial":1999,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Echodog Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Atos criminosos\r\nDrogas l\u00edcitas","rating":"12","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"true"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Rokok dan/atau rokok elektronik, minuman beralkohol, narkotika, psikotropika, dan/atau zat adiktif lainnya","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":170},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"14 May, 2020"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSigns of the Sojourner stands out by taking an intriguing approach to conversations.\u201d<br>Polygon<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s one of the most fascinating translations of human communication and connection to game mechanics I\u2019ve seen.\u201d<br>VG24/7<br><br>\u201cThis should be everywhere. It should be the indie darling of 2020. And while there\u2019s certainly something bittersweet in this immediate moment in playing a game about moving about, talking to strangers, and the intimacy of conversation, if anything it\u2019s reminded me of the great value of what we can\u2019t have in our real lives right now. This is utterly wonderful, and I implore everyone to pick it up.\u201d<br>93/100 \u2013 Buried Treasure<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058690/ss_0aa65890328c2d96e0338dc1e7bac0c2f1e34f20.1920x1080.jpg?t=1667328331","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058690/ss_0aa65890328c2d96e0338dc1e7bac0c2f1e34f20.600x338.jpg?t=1667328331"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i